      "blocks": {
        "text_MYfiJd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>STEP ONE : CONSULTATION<br/></p><p><br/>In person or virtually. We’ll review references, preferences, and parameters, then define a clear design brief. Guidance is provided on design, materials, and stone selection. A curated selection of diamonds and gemstones are sourced for each commission and will be presented to you following the consultation.</p><p>Consultations typically run 30-45 mins.</p><p>*Timelines are confirmed prior to production.<br/>*No obligation to proceed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Yztajc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>STEP TWO : DESIGN VISUALIZATION</p><p><br/>Your concept is translated into detailed CAD renderings, shared from all angles. <br/>We refine proportions and details are refined to resolution before production.<br/><br/>*High-fidelity 3D visualisation<br/>*Designs are refined to resolution before production.<br/>*A 50% deposit is taken once the design is approved.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_q68ehE": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>STEP THREE : CRAFT</p><p><br/>Following approval, production begins. Each piece is made with long-term wear, structure, and future resizing in mind. </p><p>*Ready in 4-8 weeks depending on design complexity and stone sourcing, expedited timelines are not offered.<br/>*GIA IFI Certification included where applicable.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
