            "text": "<p>STEP THREE : CRAFT</p><p><br/>Following approval, production begins. Each piece is made with long-term wear, structure, and future resizing in mind. <br/><br/>Complimentary engraving is available on all custom rings. </p><p>*Ready in 4-8 weeks depending on design complexity and stone sourcing, expedited timelines are not offered.<br/>*GIA IFI Certification included where applicable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_eprbxh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>STEP FOUR : COMPLETION & DELIVERY</p><p><br/>Once complete, we share detailed imagery and video for your review. <br/>The final balance is confirmed only once the piece is approved.</p><p>*Remaining 50% balance due upon completion.<br/>*Secure, insured DHL worldwide shipping is included.<br/>*Ongoing care and support and complimentary first resize, if required.</p>"
